    "text": " James Perkins into the show. Thanks for having me. I really appreciate you guys having me on. I know we've kind of had this planned in the previous time and now we've finally managed to get here and I'm so excited to be on the same thing. Yeah, you have such an awesome story where you were, I mean, it's awesome. It did bad at the same time. You got laid off not fired because of T2CMS. They were downsizing recession. We're seeing layoffs have all support here and you being very professional commensurate dev rel person you had so many connections that you had a job within 12 hours I believe yeah I worked with club previously and On some stuff and some freelance stuff or for Colin and a bunch of other stuff and I said a message and said hey Like lost my job and want to know if you guys are looking for dev rel and and then 12 hours later The peace paper was signed and we're all set and ready to go So it was certainly not why I expected to happen and I think I'm probably the luckiest person.",
