    "vtt": "WEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.120\nJames Perkins into the show. Thanks for having me. I really appreciate you guys having me on.\n\n00:05.120 --> 00:09.920\nI know we've kind of had this planned in the previous time and now we've finally managed to get here and I'm\n\n00:09.920 --> 00:15.680\nso excited to be on the same thing. Yeah, you have such an awesome story where you were, I mean,\n\n00:15.680 --> 00:21.920\nit's awesome. It did bad at the same time. You got laid off not fired because of T2CMS. They were\n\n00:21.920 --> 00:27.840\ndownsizing recession. We're seeing layoffs have all support here and you being very\n\n00:27.840 --> 00:33.600\nprofessional commensurate dev rel person you had so many connections that you had a job within 12 hours\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:35.600\nI believe yeah I\n\n00:35.920 --> 00:37.920\nworked with club previously and\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:45.360\nOn some stuff and some freelance stuff or for Colin and a bunch of other stuff and I said a message and said hey\n\n00:45.360 --> 00:51.280\nLike lost my job and want to know if you guys are looking for dev rel and and then 12 hours later\n\n00:51.280 --> 00:54.160\nThe peace paper was signed and we're all set and ready to go\n\n00:54.160 --> 00:59.440\nSo it was certainly not why I expected to happen and I think I'm probably the luckiest person.\n\n",
